{"id": "17-2886-2-2", "zh": "插入词缀（vikaraṇa）的规定", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2887-2-15", "zh": "isu（词根）表示“想要、喜爱”。和前面一样，删去词根末音，生成ti等语尾，并加a词缀。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2888-2-9", "zh": "在“dhātūnaṃ（诸词根的）”一语承前适用的情况下——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2889-2-7", "zh": "476. isu、yamu的末音可以变为ccha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2890-2-9", "zh": "isu、yamu这些词根的末音可以变为ccha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2890-10-25", "zh": "这里的vā一词表示有限定的选择；通过拆分规则，得出“anto ccho vā（末音可变为ccha）”，于是āsa的末音也可以这样变。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-2890-26-31", "zh": "他向往天界（so saggaṃ icchati），icchanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2890-32-35", "zh": "icchasi，icchatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2890-36-39", "zh": "icchāmi，icchāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2890-40-56", "zh": "不替换为ccha时，因为词根末尾不是复辅音，依“aññesu ca”规则作增音（vuddhi）：esati，esanti等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2891-2-13", "zh": "在被动语态中，反身语尾（attanopada）大多用为为他语尾（parassapada）的形式，所以这里我们将简略列出反身语尾的词形。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-2891-14-27", "zh": "他被想要：icchīyati，esīyati，issate，issati；其中ya音同化为前面的音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2891-28-32", "zh": "同样：icchatu，esatu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2891-33-36", "zh": "iccheyya，eseyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2891-37-47", "zh": "至于过去时（parokkhā）和昨天时（hiyyattanī）的词形，都应依照实际用例来使用。icchi，esi。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-2891-48-51", "zh": "icchissati，esissati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2891-52-56", "zh": "icchissā，esissā等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2892-2-11", "zh": "yamu（词根）表示“停止、抑制”，前面加ni，并替换为ccha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2892-12-15", "zh": "niyacchati，niyacchanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2892-16-19", "zh": "niyamati，niyamanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2892-20-33", "zh": "前面加saṃ时，依“saye ca”规则变为ña，并重复辅音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2892-34-37", "zh": "saññamati，saññamanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2893-2-11", "zh": "被动语态：niyacchīyati，niyamīyati，niyammati，也可以是saññamīyati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2893-12-16", "zh": "同样：niyacchatu，saññamatu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2893-17-20", "zh": "niyaccheyya，saññameyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2893-21-24", "zh": "niyacchī，saññamī。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2893-25-28", "zh": "niyacchissati，saññamissati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2893-29-33", "zh": "niyacchissa，saññamissa等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2894-2-10", "zh": "āsa（词根）表示“坐”，通过拆分规则替换为ccha，并变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2894-11-14", "zh": "acchati，acchanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2894-15-18", "zh": "acchasi，acchatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2894-19-22", "zh": "acchāmi，acchāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2894-23-29", "zh": "其他情况下，前面加upa：upāsati，upāsanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2894-30-33", "zh": "acchīyati，upāsīyati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2894-34-37", "zh": "acchatu，upāsatu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2894-38-41", "zh": "accheyya，upāseyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2894-42-45", "zh": "acchī，upāsī。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2894-46-49", "zh": "acchissati，upāsissati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2894-50-54", "zh": "acchissa，upāsissa等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2895-2-8", "zh": "labha（词根）表示“获得”：labhati，labhanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2895-9-12", "zh": "labhasi，labhatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2895-13-16", "zh": "labhāmi，labhāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2895-17-20", "zh": "labhate，labhante。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2895-21-24", "zh": "labhase，labhavhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2895-25-28", "zh": "labhe，labhāmhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2896-2-23", "zh": "被动语态中，ya音同化为前面的音之后，依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，前一个bha音变为ba：labbhate，labbhante。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2896-24-27", "zh": "labbhati，labbhanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2896-28-31", "zh": "labbhataṃ，labbhatu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2896-32-35", "zh": "labbhe，labbheyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2897-2-13", "zh": "在不定过去时（ajjatanī）中，“vā”和“antalopo”两语承前适用——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2898-2-9", "zh": "477. labha之后的ī、iṃ变为ttha、tthaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2899-2-19", "zh": "在labha这个词根之后的ī、iṃ两个语尾，可以分别替换为ttha、tthaṃ，同时删去词根末音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2899-20-29", "zh": "alattha，alabhi，labhi，alabhiṃsu，labhiṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2899-30-41", "zh": "alabho，labho，alabhi，labhi，alabhittha，labhittha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2899-42-52", "zh": "alatthaṃ，alabhiṃ，labhiṃ，alabhimha，labhimha等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2900-2-53", "zh": "在将来时（bhavissantī）中，由于“karassa sappaccayassa kāho”这条规则里取了“sappaccaya（带词缀的）”一词，表明vaca、muca、bhuja等词根之后的ssa可以替换为kha，vasa、chida、labha等词根之后的ssa可以替换为cha；所以这里ssa替换为cha，再依“byañjanantassa co chappaccayesu ca”规则，词根末音变为ca：lacchati，lacchanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2900-54-57", "zh": "lacchasi，lacchatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2900-58-61", "zh": "lacchāmi，lacchāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2900-62-67", "zh": "不替换为cha时：labhissati，labhissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2900-68-71", "zh": "labhissasi，labhissatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2900-72-76", "zh": "labhissāmi，labhissāma等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2900-77-81", "zh": "alabhissa，alabhissaṃsu等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2901-2-9", "zh": "vaca（词根）表示“清楚表达、说话”：vacati，vacanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2901-10-13", "zh": "vacasi，vacatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2901-14-17", "zh": "vacāmi，vacāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2902-2-9", "zh": "在被动语态中，用反身语尾并加上ya词缀之后——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2903-2-10", "zh": "478. 在ya之前，vaca、vasa、vaha等词根的va变为u。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2904-2-21", "zh": "后接ya词缀时，vaca、vasa、vaha这类词根的va音变为u；“ādi（等）”一词也把vaḍḍha包括在内。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2904-22-45", "zh": "这里应当把vassa看作“va与a”的复合词，从而认取第二个va，因此a音也变为u；在前一种情况下，则删去后面的音。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "17-2904-46-60", "zh": "依“tassa cavagga”等规则，ya音连同词根末音一起变为ca，并重复。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2904-61-64", "zh": "uccate，uccante。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2904-65-68", "zh": "vuccate，vuccante。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2904-69-74", "zh": "也可以是vuccati，vuccanti等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2904-75-79", "zh": "同样：vacatu，vuccatu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2904-80-83", "zh": "vaceyya，vucceyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2904-84-91", "zh": "avacā，avaccā，avacū，avaccū。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2904-92-97", "zh": "avaca，avaco，avacuttha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2904-98-103", "zh": "avaca，avacaṃ，avacamhā。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2904-104-106", "zh": "avacuttha等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2905-2-9", "zh": "479. 在不定过去时中，vaca的a音变为o。", "confidence": 65}
